      "writtenOn": "2017-10-04T20:47:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If Result is SUCCESS, value should never be INT32_MIN / INT64_MIN / BatteryStatus::UNKNOWN, because framework uses these values as failure values.\n\nI know this is a bad predicate on the acceptable values for this property, but it is by far the best predicate I can get. I can improve the predicates here once I get the implementation ready.",
